10-05T15:59:31Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nIn a little less than a month, Ubuntu 22 runners are set to be deprecated, with them being outright removed the following April[^1]. In the interest of staying ahead of the curve, this PR bumps all relevant Ubuntu runners to the next LTS versions. That puts the Linux-build runner at Ubuntu 24 & all other Ubuntu runners at Ubuntu 26[^2].\r\n\r\nMarking as a draft for the time being, as there are some lsan-related warnings that go a bit over my head.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n[^1]: actions/runner-images#14254\r\n[^2]: actions/runner-images#14226","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122783/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122783/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}